  "question": {
    "text": "Let $A=\\{1,6,11,16, \\ldots\\}$ and $B=\\{9,16,23,30, \\ldots\\}$ be the sets consisting of the first 2025 terms of two arithmetic progressions. Then $n(A \\cup B)$ is",
